SUMMARY:RZM FINE ARTS  & ANTIQUES\, INC PRESENTS:  ANTIQUE APPRAISAL SHOW
DESCRIPTION:BACK BY POPULAR DEMAND! Registration runs from 9:30am-11:30am. 
 \n\nThis is the opportunity to see what your inherited treasure may be 
 worth as well as learn interesting information about your item.\n\nOR just 
 come to watch and learn something new about something old. \n\nThe first 
 item to be appraised will cost $10 and each additional item will be $5 up 
 to three items total per attendee. The experts will appraise all types of 
 antiques\, collectibles and vintage items: luxury wristwatches\, art deco 
 jewelry\, military collectibles\, antique firearms\, American coins\, 
 modern art and MORE!\n\n**Please note: each coin is considered a separate 
 appraisal item. Large items cannot be accommodated**\nThe event is held to 
 benefit the Friends of the West Caldwell Public Library\n\nEmail 
 rzmantique@aol.com with questions or call the library.
