SUMMARY:Silent Book Club (West Essex Chapter)
DESCRIPTION:Silent Book Club is a global community of readers with nearly 
 2\,000 chapters in 55  countries. There's no assigned reading — it's 
 bring your own book.\n\nMore than a million members gather in person\, 
 online\, and in destinations around the world to read together and swap 
 stories. All readers are welcome!\n\nHOW IT WORKS: Bring your own book. 
 Grab a seat.  Enjoy a quiet reading hour. \n\nThere are no assigned 
 readings\, no pressure to socialize. All book formats are welcome 
 (headphones for audiobooks). \n\nFrom 5:30-6pm\, participants arrive\, find 
 their seats and chat with other book lovers about what you are reading. 
 \n\nFrom 6-7pm\, please enjoy the quiet reading hour and from 7-7:30pm you 
 can continue to read or socialize. \n\nMore info: 
 https://bookclubs.com/clubs/6085923/join/676f73/
LOCATION:West Caldwell - New Book Area
ORGANIZER;CN="West Caldwell Public Library":MAILTO:programs@westcaldwell.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Book Club
UID:LibCal-10340-15968876
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/15968876
