SUMMARY:Morning Book Club
DESCRIPTION:December 17 Thunderstruck by Erik Larson\n\nAn enthralling 
 narrative and vivid descriptions….another masterpiece of popular 
 history\, again intertwining plots that prove grippingly to bear a relation 
